      "id": 0,
      "description": "Thermal pretreatment was carried out by heating sludge samples (50 ml) at temperatures ranging from 110 °C to 150 °C for 20 min in an oil bath (Daihan Science, Korea) to enhance sludge disintegration without improving methane yield significantly."
    },
